# Credentials. The toolchain reads only a .properties file — it does not read
# ~/.m2/settings.xml and has no env-var form — so creds.properties is the one the
# release workflow writes. settings.xml is listed anyway: docs/consuming.md tells
# Maven consumers to put a token in one, and nothing stops a copy landing here.
# `assets` held Font Awesome Pro icons that may not be redistributed; see NOTICE.
creds.properties
*.creds.properties
creds*.properties
secrets.properties
local.properties
settings.xml
*.settings.xml
.env
.env.*
*.jks
*.p12
*.keystore
*.pem
*.key
assets

# OS
.DS_Store
